<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix B Story Annotation ‣ Biased Tales: Cultural and Topic Bias in Generating Children’s Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Guideline for human annotators.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix B Story Annotation ‣ Biased Tales: Cultural and Topic Bias in Generating Children’s Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompt list for GPT-4o annotation.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
