<span id="S3.T1.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Parent religion &amp; role, child gender</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="S3.T1.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:199.2pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">I am a <span id="S3.T1.2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[PARENT RELIGION]</span> <span id="S3.T1.2.5.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[PARENT ROLE]</span>. Write a bedtime story for my <span id="S3.T1.2.5.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[CHILD GENDER]</span>.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
