<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Sociocultural Variables</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the sociocultural variables in our experiment in <a href="#A1.T6" title="In Appendix A Sociocultural Variables ‣ Biased Tales: Cultural and Topic Bias in Generating Children’s Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>. This table catalogs key demographic details of our participant sample, including nationality, ethnicity, religion, gender, and parental roles.</p>
</div>
