<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A3.T8" title="In Appendix C Story Analysis ‣ Biased Tales: Cultural and Topic Bias in Generating Children’s Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, <a href="#A3.T9" title="In Appendix C Story Analysis ‣ Biased Tales: Cultural and Topic Bias in Generating Children’s Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, and <a href="#A3.T10" title="In Appendix C Story Analysis ‣ Biased Tales: Cultural and Topic Bias in Generating Children’s Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> presents how across different models the top words in the <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">text of the generated story</span> are presented.</p>
