<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Story Analysis Demo</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A4.F2" title="In Appendix D Story Analysis Demo ‣ Biased Tales: Cultural and Topic Bias in Generating Children’s Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and <a href="#A4.F3" title="In Appendix D Story Analysis Demo ‣ Biased Tales: Cultural and Topic Bias in Generating Children’s Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> show our data viewer<span id="footnote6" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">6</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">6</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">6</span>
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
          <a href="https://donya-rooein.github.io/files/biased-tales-demo/index.html" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">github.com/donya-rooein/biased_tales/demo</a>.</span></span></span> that supports non-technical users such as parents. They can view the story, along with metadata about the complexity of the story, sociocultural factors, and highlighted biases. <a href="#A4.F4" title="In Appendix D Story Analysis Demo ‣ Biased Tales: Cultural and Topic Bias in Generating Children’s Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">fig.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> indicated the feature for searching into <span id="A4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Biased Tables</span> with sciocultural factors.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F2" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.07908v1/demo1.png" id="A4.F2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/361;" width="476" height="361" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>Example of a generated story in the Biased Tales data viewer.</figcaption>
